_where \(\Omega=(-1,1)^{2}\) and the solution \(u\) is \(u(x,y)=(xe^{1-|x|}-x)(ye^{1-|y|}-y)\) which is one of our testing functions. It is easy to see those coefficients satisfy the Cordes condition_

